  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Based at 909 chemin de Font de Currault, on the edge of the Parc de la Valmasque, Club Canin Mouginois offers dog training, agility and hoopers classes on Wednesdays and Saturdays.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The club has its own official website (clubcaninmouginois.com), confirmed by a specialist directory (chien.com) and a mention on a dog-training site (ecoleduchiot.fr). Correction on the times: two independent, consistent sources (sports-canins.net, telephone.city) give 2pm-5pm on Wednesdays and Saturdays, not 3pm as previously stated. A first trial session is free.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the Parc de la Valmasque right next door makes it easy to extend the outing with a walk in the forest.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Parc de la Valmasque, with its equestrian centre and trails, is directly accessible from the club.</p>
